to support the concept of a government letter delivery monopoly. I was simply  
calling into question what appeared to be an inadequately supported  
*assumption* that such a monolpoly existed through force of law. The point of  
the original thread, that fraud of the USPS is a legitimate  
anarcho-capitalist action, could be seen to hinge on this point.

