pointed out that the manner in which Perry stated his challenge is ambiguous  
and unprovable. If you are going to offer a bet as an incentive to finding  
answers, you need to do it in such a way that the taker is encouraged to be  
as thorough and exact as possible. 


[side-discussion of new(?) uses for alt.extropian]
